Subject: [PATCH] video encoder: support standard V4L2 H264 and VP8 encoders

Register v4l2h264enc/v4l2vp8enc with their common standard bitrate/GOP
controls. Allow camera NV12 input instead of forcing I420 conversion.
Keep H264 profile/level constraints, including RTP preferences where
GStreamer splits profile-level-id into separate fields. H264 access units
are converted to AVC by h264parse; VP8 frames need no parser.

--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/gstreamer/VideoEncoderPrivateGStreamer.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/gstreamer/VideoEncoderPrivateGStreamer.cpp
@@ -128,6 +128,8 @@
